    ".claude/commands/quick-plan.md": "The ARCHITECT/planner: allowed-tools Read/Write/Edit/Glob/Grep; takes USER_PROMPT; writes a concise implementation spec to specs/<name>.md. Pinned to model claude-opus-4-1-20250805 (a course-era model id).",
