    <article class="chapter-feature">
      <div class="chapter-feature__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume II · Lesson 11</p>
        <h2>Building Domain-Specific Agents</h2>
        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Control context, model, prompt, and tools in code; climb an eight-agent ladder from Pong to a producer/consumer log system; and learn when not to build custom.</p>
        <ul class="chapter-feature__meta"><li>Tactic · Build Custom Agents</li><li>90–150 min core lab</li><li>12 full-width course frames</li><li>2 verified practice overlays</li></ul>
        <a class="button" href="vol-2-ah/11-building-domain-specific-agents.html">Start chapter →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="chapter-feature__map" aria-label="Agentic path visual">
        <div class="focus-three"><div>Better agents</div><div>More agents</div><div>Custom agents</div></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="tac-heading">
      <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Volume I</p><h2 id="tac-heading">Tactical Agentic Coding</h2></div><p>8 of 8 chapters · 100%</p></div>
      <div class="lesson-list">
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">01</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/01-hello-agentic-coding.html">Hello Agentic Coding</a></strong><p>Tactic: Stop Coding · Gold chapter</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">02</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/02-the-12-leverage-points.html">The 12 Leverage Points</a></strong><p>Tactic: Adopt Your Agent’s Perspective · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">03</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/03-success-is-planned.html">Success is Planned</a></strong><p>Tactic: Template Your Engineering · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">04</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/04-afk-agents.html">AFK Agents</a></strong><p>Tactic: Stay Out The Loop · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">05</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/05-close-the-loops.html">Close the Loops</a></strong><p>Tactic: Always Add Feedback Loops · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">06</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/06-let-your-agents-focus.html">Let Your Agents Focus</a></strong><p>Tactic: One Agent, One Prompt, One Purpose · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">07</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/07-zte-secret-of-agentic-engineering.html">ZTE Secret of Agentic Engineering</a></strong><p>Tactic: Target Zero-Touch Engineering · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">08</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/08-the-agentic-layer.html">The Agentic Layer</a></strong><p>Tactic: Prioritize Agentics · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="ah-heading">
      <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Volume II</p><h2 id="ah-heading">Agentic Horizon</h2></div><p>2 of 6 chapters · 33.3%</p></div>
      <div class="lesson-list">
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">09</span><div><strong>Elite Context Engineering</strong><p>Chapter pending</p></div><span class="badge badge--pending">Pending</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">10</span><div><strong><a href="vol-2-ah/10-seven-levels-agentic-prompt-formats.html">Seven Levels Agentic Prompt Formats</a></strong><p>Tactic: Master the Seven Agentic Prompt Formats · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">11</span><div><strong><a href="vol-2-ah/11-building-domain-specific-agents.html">Building Domain-Specific Agents</a></strong><p>Tactic: Build Custom Agents · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">12</span><div><strong>Multi-Agent Orchestration: The O-Agent</strong><p>Chapter pending</p></div><span class="badge badge--pending">Pending</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">13</span><div><strong>Agent Experts</strong><p>Chapter pending</p></div><span class="badge badge--pending">Pending</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">14</span><div><strong>Building Agentic Layers</strong><p>Chapter pending</p></div><span class="badge badge--pending">Pending</span></div>
