+  <meta name="description" content="A teaching-first companion to Agentic Horizon lesson 1: measure, reduce, delegate, and deliberately own an agent's context window through twelve course-grounded techniques.">
+  <title>AH-1 · Elite Context Engineering — IndyDevDan Expert Book</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../design/tokens.css">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../design/base.css">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../design/components.css">
